      "theme": "The universe anticipates her. She doesn't create the world — the world remembers it was always supposed to exist when she arrives.",
      "palette": [
        "Absolute Void Black — the undrawn world",
        "Warm Ivory Gold — the emerging architecture",
        "Deep Indigo — the transition between nothing and something",
        "Skin Warm Amber — her alone, always lit"
      ],
      "emotional_core": "Not power. Not magic. The quiet certainty of someone who knows the territory before the map exists.",
      "internal_physics_rule": "ONE LAW GOVERNS EVERYTHING: The world appears 0.5 seconds before her foot lands. Not after. Before. The universe anticipates her weight."
    },

    "identity": {
      "character": "GEMS FEMALE — CHARACTER REFERENCE LOCKED",
      "preserve": "facial geometry, eye shape, jawline, lip contour, skin texture — every frame, every second",
      "age": "28-32. Lean athletic build. Zero beautification. Real pores, real skin.",
      "attire": "Simple white linen dress — floor length, bare shoulders. No tactical gear. No fashion. She looks like someone who just woke up and decided to build a city.",
      "hair": "Down. Moving only with her steps. No wind. No drama. Just weight and gravity.",
      "expression": "Not wonder. Not concentration. The face of someone reading a map they drew themselves — already knowing every street."
    },

    "action_sequence": {

      "act_1": {
        "seconds": "0.0 — 3.0",
        "visual": "Pure black void — infinite, weightless, directionless. She walks INTO frame from the left. With each step she takes, cobblestone appears exactly 0.5 seconds before her foot lands — warm ivory stone, perfectly detailed, emerging from nothing as if always there but invisible. Behind her: a growing trail of real cobblestone street stretching into void. The stones don't build — they ARRIVE. Like they were always there and the darkness was the error.",
        "camera": "Wide shot, low angle. She is centered but small. The void around her is vast. We see the trail of emerged cobblestone behind her. The contrast between the warm stone and the absolute black is the entire frame.",
        "physics": "The cobblestones have mass — they cast shadows on each other. Micro-dust rises from each one as it arrives. The void has no reflection, no depth, no atmosphere. It is the absence of physics. She is the presence of it.",
        "lighting": "She is lit by the stones as they appear — warm amber rising from below each new section. No external light source. She generates her own illumination through the world she triggers."
      },

      "transition": {
        "seconds": "3.0 — 5.0",
        "soul": "She stops. The world stops arriving. For exactly one second — absolute stillness. Then she raises her right hand slowly toward the void in front of her. One finger extended. She begins to draw a line in the air. WHERE HER FINGER PASSES: Gran Vía Madrid builds itself — not in pieces, not constructing — ARRIVING, fully formed in sections, like a memory being recovered. The Schweppes sign. The facades. The streetlights igniting. The wet pavement reflecting amber. All of it in 1.5 seconds of her single continuous gesture. She doesn't look at what she's building. She looks at where the line ends.",
    "negatives": [
      "buildings constructing brick by brick — they must ARRIVE, not build",
      "any light source other than the emerging cobblestone in Act 1",
      "she looks at what she's creating — she already knows it",
  }
}

