prompt: cinematic.text:
@alexgreycosm makes some amazing inspiring masterpieces.

Here’s my prompt bringing his vision to life with Grok (6 sec) vs. Gemini’s Veo (8 sec):

Animate and bring to life in hyper-realistic dynamic ways based on what the artist says this artwork represents: “the painting is called Higher Self, and it came in a flash meditation, it is a succession, once the higher worlds are revealed…it doesn’t mean it’s the end… there are increasingly higher worlds, so we continue to yearn Godward, and each disclosure of visionary realm opens up to a new one, until you get to this point where the being is kind of following a light… and this is all about the creative will… and about how when we open up we can be pulled by a higher force.” Ideally, you’d masterfully animate it to reveal this process until the being reaches and dwells in God in the end. No need to add the text nor read the text aloud, just make it come to life and give it a cinematic feel with a heartfelt melodic award-winning film score.

